# Build context for deploy/bookshelf-server/Dockerfile.
#
# The context is the REPO ROOT, which holds node_modules, the foundry-app
# subtree, packaging output and the whole source tree — gigabytes that would be
# uploaded to the daemon on every build and then thrown away. So: exclude
# everything, and name the five things the image actually copies.
#
# BuildKit reads a <dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile in
# preference to the context root's .dockerignore, so this stays scoped to this
# image and changes nothing else in the repo.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!cli
!dist/electron
!dist/shared
